  "scope": "The publication retains the original square-zero trace defects, bounded coefficient partition, prime-power classification, factor-sum and fixed-tail-sum maps, Pell specialization, complete inverse fibres, and map-specific prime-square obstructions. The corrected source states the exact domain of the factor-sum inverse and the full reciprocal hypothesis for the trace coordinates. It does not claim a universal source, terminating descent, or an Erdős–Straus proof or counterexample.",
